  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Discovering Sexual and Reproductive Health challenges and designing an appropria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maternal and new-born deaths remain very high in Malawi. There is inadequate access to sexual and reproductive health services, low involvement of men in decision making, and low capacity of staff to deliver quality services.  This Generating Ideas project will focus on one district and will result in a thorough consultation of the main needs.  The learning from the consultation will identify the key health priorities and how they can be most effectively tackled through engaging with Community Action Groups and other key community players and organisations in the district.</narrative>
  </description>
